# Load-bearing: without it npm resolves optional peers and pulls react-dom 19.3 and react-native-gesture-handler 3.x,
# which do not match the Expo SDK 58 pins (react-dom 19.3.0, react-native-gesture-handler ~3.3.0; npm would take 19.3.1 and 3.4.0). Re-checked on the SDK 58 upgrade with `npm install --dry-run --legacy-peer-deps=false`; re-check after each SDK upgrade.
legacy-peer-deps=true
